#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.cummax.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.cummax"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.cumulative._make_cumulative.<locals>._cumulative:1
#: of
msgid "Cumulative max of column values, preserving row order."
msgstr "累积最大值，保持行顺序。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.cumulative._make_cumulative.<locals>._cumulative:3
#: of
msgid ""
"NaN positions are masked (the output is null where the input is null) "
"when ``skipna=True``.  When ``skipna=False``, NaN propagates forward — "
"once a null is encountered, all subsequent values become null."
msgstr ""
"当 ``skipna=True`` 时，NaN 位置被屏蔽（输出在输入为 null 的地方为 null）"
"。当 ``skipna=False`` 时，NaN 向前传播——一旦遇到 null，所有后续值都变为 "
"null。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.cumulative._make_cumulative.<locals>._cumulative
#: of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.cumulative._make_cumulative.<locals>._cumulative:7
#: of
msgid ""
"If True, skip null values in the cumulative computation but mask their "
"positions to null in the output.  If False, null propagates forward (all "
"subsequent values become null)."
msgstr ""
"如果为 True，在累积计算中跳过 null 值但在输出中将其位置屏蔽为 null。如果"
"为 False，null 向前传播（所有后续值都变为 null）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.cumulative._make_cumulative.<locals>._cumulative:11
#: of
msgid ""
"Column(s) to transform.  If None, all columns are transformed. Non-"
"selected columns are passed through unchanged."
msgstr "要转换的列。如果为 None，则转换所有列。未选择的列保持不变通过。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.cumulative._make_cumulative.<locals>._cumulative
#: of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.cumulative._make_cumulative.<locals>._cumulative:15
#: of
msgid "Cumulative max LiteFrame with same shape and columns."
msgstr "具有相同形状和列的累积最大值 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.cumulative._make_cumulative.<locals>._cumulative
#: of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.cumulative._make_cumulative.<locals>._cumulative
#: of
msgid "抛出"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.cumulative._make_cumulative.<locals>._cumulative:18
#: of
msgid ""
"If any transformed column is non-numeric, or if cummax     is called on a"
" decimal column (cumprod only — polars cum_prod     does not support "
"decimal)."
msgstr "如果任何转换列为非数值类型，或在小数列上调用 cummax（仅 cumprod — polars cum_prod 不支持小数）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.cumulative._make_cumulative.<locals>._cumulative:21
#: of
